WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
Flaky-test repair
must preserve test meaning.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:08.000
Reproduce the unstable behavior
and collect its conditions before

00:00:08.048 --> 00:00:11.600
proposing a change. Execution paths,

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.720
timing and shared state
can guide diagnosis.

00:00:14.853 --> 00:00:19.960
Validate the candidate under varied
conditions and inspect the assertions.

00:00:20.027 --> 00:00:24.000
Deleting a check may make a test stable
while hiding the original problem.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:28.800
Retain repeatability evidence and reject
repairs that trade away fault detection.
